#! solo --size 80x18 --faux scripts/proof/tui_see/paced.jsonl
# A recorded reply (7.7 s on the wire) streams at its recorded cadence on a frozen clock.
# It stops before the reply ends: what lands after the last delta (the turn's end and its
# elapsed label) arrives in real time, so a frozen frame cannot include it.
wait-frame 5000 faux-1
type what tools do you have available?
key enter
wait-frame 5000 what tools do you have
snap-strip paced 5 1900
quit
